## Build output
/dist/
/bin/

## CodeQL
.cache/
.codeql/
# BQRS and SARIF files are blanket-ignored, so a
# checked-in fixture needs its own negation here
# or in a more specific `.gitignore` -- Without a
# negation, `git add` skips it silently, which looks
# exactly like a fixture that was never generated.
*.bqrs
*.sarif

## CodeQL query-test artifacts (.expected files are checked in; these are not)
*.testproj/
*.actual

## ABOM artifacts and databases
/analyses/
/output/
*.db
*.db.gz
*.zip
abom-graph.json
abom-dashboard.json

## Logs
/logs/

# Agent working notes, deliberately untracked. Git history is already the record of what shipped;
# a markdown summary of it becomes a second copy that drifts from the log it duplicates. The
# reasoning behind each entry is worth keeping locally, so agents keep it here.
/plans/implemented.md

## .NET
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## OS generated, hidden files
.DS_Store

## Temporary by nature
*.swo
*.swp

